WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
CITI-FX: Renata, thanks for calling back, we are still working that EUR/USD block.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Renata: Sorry about the delay, I was pulled into a risk meeting. Still two hundred fifty million?

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
CITI-FX: Still two hundred fifty million into the WM fix, client wants your axe now.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Renata: Let me check where we are, mid is around one point zero nine one two right now.

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Renata: I can show three tenths either side on the full amount if you want to work it.

6
00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
CITI-FX: That works for the client, they are comfortable with that spread given the size.

7
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Renata: Good. Do you want to work it into the fix or take a clean risk price now?

8
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:40.000
CITI-FX: They would prefer to work it into the fix if you are comfortable managing that.

9
00:02:40.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Renata: I am comfortable with that, I will start slicing it in the next twenty minutes.

10
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:20.000
CITI-FX: Perfect, I will let the client know their axe is confirmed.

11
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:40.000
Renata: One thing, if she moves more than five pips against us I will call before continuing.

12
00:03:40.000 --> 00:04:00.000
CITI-FX: Understood, that is fair given the size.

13
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:20.000
Renata: Also I heard there was an earlier attempt to reach me this morning, apologies for the delay.

14
00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:40.000
CITI-FX: No worries, we appreciate you getting back to us before the window closes.

15
00:04:40.000 --> 00:05:00.000
Renata: Of course. I will confirm the fill summary once the fix prints.

16
00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:20.000
CITI-FX: Sounds good, we will be standing by.

17
00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:40.000
Renata: Talk soon.
